                "q": "The required weights (Kg) and price (Rs. per Kg) of monthly items required by a family are given. Find weighted mean prices using A.M., G.M. and H.M.\nItem | A | B | C | D | E\nPrice (Rs. per Kg) | 300 | 200 | 600 | 250 | 650\nRequired weight (Kg) | 25 | 5 | 4 | 8 | 3"
