                "a": "x: 7.2, 7.5, 7.8, 8.1, 8.4, 8.7, 9.0\nf: 3, 5, 9, 14, 11, 6, 2\nn = 50\nx̄ = [[Σxf/Σf]]\n= [[(7.2 x 3 + 7.5 x 5 + 7.8 x 9 + 8.1 x 14 + 8.4 x 11 + 8.7 x 6 + 9.0 x 2)/50]]\n= [[(21.6 + 37.5 + 70.2 + 113.4 + 92.4 + 52.2 + 18)/50]]\n= [[405.3/50]]\n= 8.106 Kg\nd = 0.1\nLCB (7.1-7.3) = 7.05\nUCB (8.9-9.1) = 9.15\nRange = 9.15 - 7.05\n= 2.1 Kg\nΣ(x - x̄)^2 f = (7.2 - 8.106)^2 x 3 + (7.5 - 8.106)^2 x 5 + (7.8 - 8.106)^2 x 9 + (8.1 - 8.106)^2 x 14 + (8.4 - 8.106)^2 x 11 + (8.7 - 8.106)^2 x 6 + (9.0 - 8.106)^2 x 2\n= 2.462 + 1.836 + 0.843 + 0.001 + 0.951 + 2.117 + 1.599\n= 9.809\nVar = [[9.809/50]]\n= 0.196\nS.D. = √0.196\n= 0.443 Kg\nΣ|x - x̄|f = 0.906 x 3 + 0.606 x 5 + 0.306 x 9 + 0.006 x 14 + 0.294 x 11 + 0.594 x 6 + 0.894 x 2\n= 2.718 + 3.03 + 2.754 + 0.084 + 3.234 + 3.564 + 1.788\n= 17.172\nM.D. = [[17.172/50]]\n= 0.343 Kg",
