                    "a": "[[T]]Compound|Flame Colour;;LiCl|Red flame;;NaCl|Yellow flame;;KCl|Light lilac flame;;RbCl|Violet flame;;CaCl2|Orange red flame;;SrCl2|Red or crimson flame;;BaCl2|Light green flame;;CuCl2|Blue/Green flame[[/T]]",
                    "q": "What colours do LiCl, NaCl, KCl, RbCl, CaCl2, SrCl2, BaCl2 and CuCl2 show in the flame test?"
