                  {
                    "a": "In qualitative analysis, the sample may be solid, liquid, gas or a mixture.",
                    "q": "In what state can the sample be in qualitative analysis?"
                  },
                  {
                    "a": "Examples of qualitative analysis are chemical tests, flame tests and colour changes.",
                    "q": "Write some examples of qualitative analysis."
                  }
