                    "a": "After weighing, sugarcane is loaded by hand or crane onto a moving table. The table carries the cane into one or two sets of revolving knives, which chop the cane into chips in order to expose the tissue and open the cell structure, thus readying the material for efficient extraction of the juice.",
                    "q": "How is the juice of sugar cane extracted?"
