                    "q": "If 50 waves pass through a point in the rope in 10 seconds, what are the frequency and the period of the wave? If its wavelength is 8 cm, calculate the wave speed. Explain the type of wave produced. (5Hz, 0.2s, 0.4ms^-1)"
