                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]C1 = 4 μF, C2 = 3 μF, C3 = 2 μF (in series)[[/E]][[S]]Equivalent capacitance in series:[[/S]][[E]]1/Ce = 1/C1 + 1/C2 + 1/C3[[/E]][[S]]Substitute the values:[[/S]][[E]]1/Ce = 1/4 + 1/3 + 1/2[[/E]][[S]]Calculate:[[/S]][[E]]1/Ce = (3 + 4 + 6)/12 = 13/12[[/E]][[E]]Ce = 12/13 = 0.92 μF[[/E]][[A]]The equivalent capacitance is 0.92 μF. [[/A]]",
