                    "q": "Resistances of 4 Ω, 6 Ω, and 12 Ω are connected in parallel and then connected to a 6V emf source. Determine the value of i. The circuit's equivalent resistance. (2 Ω) ii. The total current flowing through the circuit. (3 A) iii. The current that flows through each resistance. (1.5 A, 1 A, 0.5 A)"
