                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]I = 4 A[[/E]][[E]]l = 15 cm = 0.15 m[[/E]][[E]]B = 0.8 T[[/E]][[E]]θ = 30°[[/E]][[S]]Force on a current-carrying conductor:[[/S]][[E]]F = BIL sin θ[[/E]][[S]]Substitute the values:[[/S]][[E]]F = 0.8 × 4 × 0.15 × sin 30°[[/E]][[S]]Calculate:[[/S]][[E]]F = 0.8 × 4 × 0.15 × 0.5 = 0.24 N[[/E]][[A]]The force acting on the wire is 0.24 N. [[/A]]",
